{"user": "Good, that worked, got some pieces back! Now my options are g2, b6, a7, c8 - only 8 empty squares left total. Which move now?", "user_ts": "2026-08-11T01:03:07.262678+00:00", "assistant": "Play **c8**.\n\nKey reason: it\u2019s the safest endgame move here because it **doesn\u2019t open up a corner immediately** the way some edge moves can, and it keeps White\u2019s replies more limited. At 8 empties, that mobility/control matters more than the immediate flip count.", "assistant_started_ts": "2026-08-11T01:03:07.262678+00:00", "assistant_ts": "2026-08-11T01:03:12.262678+00:00", "annotation_user": {"final": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Solution Request"], "consensus": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Solution Request"], "votes": {"Think Aloud": 3, "Solution Request": 3, "Conversational Acknowledgment": 2}, "confidence": {"Think Aloud": 1.0, "Solution Request": 1.0, "Conversational Acknowledgment": 0.6666666666666666}, "per_model": {"llama": ["Think Aloud", "Solution Request"], "gpt": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Solution Request"], "sonnet": ["Think Aloud", "Conversational Acknowledgment", "Solution Request"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false}, "annotation_assistant_fine": {"final": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "consensus": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "votes": {"Move Verdict": 3, "Local Justification": 3, "General Principle": 3}, "confidence": {"Move Verdict": 1.0, "Local Justification": 1.0, "General Principle": 1.0}, "per_model": {"gpt": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "llama": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"], "sonnet": ["Move Verdict", "Local Justification", "General Principle"]}, "n_valid": 3, "min_votes": 2, "no_majority": false, "needs_review": false, "arbiter_used": false, "coarse": ["Provide Correct Answe